BandC <onefunus@yahoo.com> wrote:

>My question is this: Although the game itself is very detailed, I 
>hardly see any detailed stats in the game: such as combat stats (X hits 
>for Y damage, Z HP left), or item stats (this item  does X damage, this 
>item weighs Y kg). I can see my own attributes like STR etc. but that's 
>not very useful because I don't know what they exactly mean since I 
>can't see how they work (for example how much damage STR gives me or how 
>much it lets me carry etc.) Is there an option to turn on to see all 
>kind of detailed stats about the game? 

No. There are in-game items to give you more detailed information about
yourself (potions and wands of enlightenment) and other monsters
(stethoscopes). 

>I'd like to know how things exactly work and I like it when numbers add up. 

Either read the source code (really; this is not uncommon among NetHack
players) or benefit from the work of others who did so and created
extensive tables and detailed explanations of the game mechanics. The
spoilers at <http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/> should get you
started.

